WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
- I loved you in "3rd Rock,"

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.420
so, is it true that your Mom once,

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.620
this is first of all,

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.920
I love your Mom and want to meet her

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:06.810
just from this story.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:07.643
(chuckles)

00:00:07.643 --> 00:00:08.476
- I heard she released bugs

00:00:08.476 --> 00:00:10.740
in your co-star (chuckles)
John Lithgow's dressing room.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.417
Like, first of all, bold,
- [Joseph] Yes.

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:13.500
(audience chuckling)

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.540
like super bold,

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:15.500
just like showin' out.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.410
- This is context, but you're right.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.070
My Mom is bold. That's true.
- I was like, wow.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:18.903
- My Mom is a badass.

00:00:18.903 --> 00:00:19.850
- What kind of bugs?

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.380
- Okay, so this started on April Fool's.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.890
John Lithgow played a prank on everybody

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.600
and he told everybody royalty is coming,

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.020
Prince, I don't remember which prince,

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.030
I don't really keep track of the Royals.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.313
- I don't either.

00:00:32.313 --> 00:00:33.580
And like he sent out a whole memo,

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.320
and like made it look very official,

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.587
and you have to dress nicely.

00:00:36.587 --> 00:00:37.420
- [Kelly] (laughs)

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.030
And like, my Mom got
me dressed up in a suit

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.180
because she got the memo

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.840
that Prince is coming or whatever.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.710
Turned out it was an
April Fool's prank, right?

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.760
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:45.770
So, and she-
- That's elaborate.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:46.750
She was the only one

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.042
that like got fooled.

00:00:48.042 --> 00:00:48.875
- Oh.

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:51.880
So she decided, okay, I'm
gonna get this guy back.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.075
And at the time I had a pet lizard,

00:00:54.075 --> 00:00:55.000
like a pet,

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.700
and it was called, you
know, a bearded dragon.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.915
You have you ever seen those lizards?

00:00:57.915 --> 00:00:58.748
- [Kelly] Yeah, yeah!

00:00:58.748 --> 00:00:59.870
- We would feed her live crickets.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.320
So we would go to the pet store every week

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.820
and bring home a bag of live crickets

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:04.750
to feed to my lizard.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.160
- Please tell me she released crickets.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.450
- So she went to the pet store,

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:08.769
got a bag of live crickets,

00:01:08.769 --> 00:01:09.602
(audience laughs)

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.435
got someone to let her

00:01:10.435 --> 00:01:11.730
into (chuckling) John
Lithgow's dressing room

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:13.690
and just let all the live crickets

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:15.034
out in his room. (chuckles)

00:01:15.034 --> 00:01:16.433
(audience claps and laughs)

00:01:16.433 --> 00:01:17.266
- I love

00:01:17.266 --> 00:01:18.319
your Mom.

00:01:18.319 --> 00:01:20.570
And you know that someone let her in

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:22.096
because that's someone
was also probably folding

00:01:22.096 --> 00:01:23.050
their formal attire.

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:24.190
- Yeah, right, exactly.

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:25.023
She's wheelin' and dealin'.

00:01:25.023 --> 00:01:26.370
- We're going to get this guy, yeah.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.340
That's amazing, your Mom is awesome.

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:29.343
- My Mom is awesome, Kelly.

00:01:29.343 --> 00:01:31.090
- That is so cool.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.940
- Can I just say that again on television?

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:34.046
- My Mom, I'm so in love with her.

00:01:34.046 --> 00:01:34.879
- She's so cool

00:01:34.879 --> 00:01:35.712
(audience cheers)

00:01:35.712 --> 00:01:36.795
and so funny.

